// Whether the page has changed since it was drawn, for changes that are not a click on the button, and the
// once-a-frame work of the name box.

// Record that the page has changed when the answer of gui_textbox_event or gui_textbox_tick has its
// "redraw" bit (1) set.
ab_mark(int ab_r) {
  int[] ab_cell = (import ab_flag);
  if(ab_r % 2 == 1) {
    ab_cell[0] = 1;
  }
} return void;
given ab_doc (1):() then ab_take:(1)
